==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|чанда́л}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|чанда́л|a=an}}

# {{lb|ru|folklore}} a [[humanoid]] creature common in northern Asian mythology; during its winter [[hibernation]], the [[mucus]], which flows out of its nose all the way down to the ground, freezes into an [[icicle]]; if this icicle breaks, the creature dies.

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|чанда́л|a=an}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|чанда́л}}

# a kind of traditional [[Yukaghir]] house made of earth and wood

